
# Dynamic Programming 2D problems:

# 62.Unique Paths

```python
class Solution:
    def uniquePaths(self, m: int, n: int) -> int:

        def call(i,j):

            if(i<0 or j<0 or i>m or j>n):
                return 0
            if(i==0 and j==0):
                return 1
            if(DP[i][j]!=-1):
                return DP[i][j]
            up=call(i,j-1)
            left=call(i-1,j)
            DP[i][j]=up+left
            
            return DP[i][j]
        DP=[[-1 for i in range(n)] for i in range(m)]
        return call(m-1,n-1)
        

```
